<title>UK: Credit Suisse set warrants on Daimler Benz.</title>
<headline>Credit Suisse set warrants on Daimler Benz.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Suisse (Zurich) siad it has issued one million American-style call warrants, on common shares of Daimler Benz AG.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    100 DEM		   PREMIUM	11.09 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     6.15 CHF		  GEARING	17.7 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 02.DEC.96-30.JAN.98   PAYDATE	29.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   NONE			MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  96.80 CHF</p>
<p> NOTES	     - </p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
